  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building global capacity to increase transparency in the forest sector (CBIT-Forest) (MSP) (FSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen institutional and technical capacities of developing countries, through a coordinated global and national forest-related data collection, analysis and dissemination process, to meet the enhanced transparency requirements of the Paris Agreement and contribute with information necessary to track progress made in implementing and achieving the nationally determined contributions (NDC).</narrative>
  </description>
